{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --input-type=module - <<'JS'\ntry{const {ALL_MODELS,MODELS}=await import('./src/art/models.js');const {checkModel,validateTexture}=await import('./pixel-engine.js');const {flame}=await import('./src/art/textures.js');for(const m of ALL_MODELS){try{const r=checkModel(m,{catalog:MODELS});if(r.problems.length)console.log(m.id,r.problems);}catch(e){console.log(m.id,e.message);}}console.log('Texture:',validateTexture(flame));}catch(e){console.log(e.message);console.log(e.stack?.split('\\\\n').slice(0,5).join('\\\\n'));}\nJS\nsed -n '3270,3375p' API.md\nsed -n '1345,1386p' API.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --input-type=module - <<'JS'\ntry{const {ALL_MODELS,MODELS}=await import('./src/art/models.js');const {checkModel,validateTexture}=await import('./pixel-engine.js');const {flame}=await import('./src/art/textures.js');for(const m of ALL_MODELS){try{const r=checkModel(m,{catalog:MODELS});if(r.problems.length)console.log(m.id,r.problems);}catch(e){console.log(m.id,e.message);}}console.log('Texture:',validateTexture(flame));}catch(e){console.log(e.message);console.log(e.stack?.split('\\\\n').slice(0,5).join('\\\\n'));}\nJS\nsed -n '3270,3375p' API.md\nsed -n '1345,1386p' API.md\"","aggregated_output":"model id \"cage\" is already in this catalog\nError: model id \"cage\" is already in this catalog\n    at CG.add (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-063014__x07393c/work/Hardly-Far-Cry-Far-Cry-2-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-063014/pixel-engine.js:543:124410)\n    at new fG (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-063014__x07393c/work/Hardly-Far-Cry-Far-Cry-2-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-063014/pixel-engine.js:543:124320)\n    at new CG (file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-063014__x07393c/work/Hardly-Far-Cry-Far-Cry-2-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-063014/pixel-engine.js:543:127439)\n    at file:///home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-063014__x07393c/work/Hardly-Far-Cry-Far-Cry-2-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-063014/src/art/models.js:41:21\n\nA pack's textures as a catalog of their own (empty for a pack of models only).\n\n### parsePack()\n\n```ts\nfunction parsePack(data: unknown, where = 'pack'): ModelPack\n```\n\nCheck a pack file's shape (the models' and textures' own checks are `validateModel`'s and `validateTexture`'s).\n\n### class PngError\n\nA PNG the decoder can't read, with what is wrong.\n\n- `new PngError(message: string)`\n\n### preloadModels()\n\n```ts\nfunction preloadModels(urls: readonly string[]): void\n```\n\nStart downloading (and parsing) models now, without waiting for them. Later\n`loadModel` calls for the same URLs reuse the in-flight requests. The engine calls this\nwith `Game.assets` before the renderer and physics initialise.\n\n### interface RgbaImage\n\nRGBA, 4 bytes a pixel, row by row from the top (the shape `encodePng` takes).\n\n- `readonly width: number`\n- `readonly height: number`\n- `readonly data: Uint8ClampedArray`\n\n### rowOf()\n\n```ts\nfunction rowOf(n: number, step: Vec3, part: Each<[i: number]>): Part[]\n```\n\n`n` copies, copy `i` offset by `i × step`.\n\n### scatterOf()\n\n```ts\nfunction scatterOf(n: number, [w, d]: readonly [number, number], seed: number, part: Each<[i: number, rng: Rng]>): Part[]\n```\n\n`n` copies scattered over a `w × d` area centred on the origin, from their own `seed` (so the\nresult does not depend on the build's seed); `part(i, rng)` may draw from the same stream.\n\n### searchDefs()\n\n```ts\nfunction searchDefs(defs: readonly T[], text: string, o: SearchOptions = {}): T[]\n```\n\nDefs ranked by how well they match `text` (any order; plurals and partial words count), best\nfirst. Each word scores most when it names a part of the id (4) or a tag (3), less in `about`\n(2), least as the start (1) or the inside (0.5) of a longer word. Every word must match; when\nno def matches them all, the defs matching the most words come back instead, so a search for\n\"oak tree stump\" still finds the stumps. Empty text: every def (after `tags`). Ties keep the\ndefs' own order, except that a pack's defs (ids with a prefix) whose name starts with a query\nword take that pack's first places in the tie: `kenney-nature/rock-large-a` before\n`kenney-nature/cliff-block-rock` for \"rock\". A pack's n…\n\n### interface SearchHit\n\nOne result of `searchHits`: the def, its score, and whether it matched every word.\n\n- `readonly def: T`\n- `readonly score: number`\n- `readonly full: boolean`\n\n### searchHits()\n\n```ts\nfunction searchHits(defs: readonly T[], text: string, o: SearchOptions = {}): SearchHit<T>[]\n```\n\n`searchDefs` with each def's score, and whether it matched every word (false: the fallback).\n\n### interface SearchOptions\n\n- `readonly tags?: readonly string[]`: Only defs with every one of these tags.\n- `readonly limit?: number`: At most this many (default: every match).\n\n### searchWords()\n\n```ts\nfunction searchWords(text: string): string[]\n```\n\nLower-case words of letters and digits: `bookcaseClosed_wide-2` → bookcase, closed, wide, 2.\n\n### setAssetReader()\n\n```ts\nfunction setAssetReader(read: AssetReader | null): void\n```\n\nWhere models and packs come from, for the whole process (`loadModel` and `loadPack` share one\ncache): a reader, or null for the page's way (fetch under the base URL). Loads already made stay cached.\n\n### interface SheetImport\n```ts\nconst TOON_BANDS: readonly [96, 176, 255]\n```\n\n3-band toon ramp (shadow / mid / lit). Sampled with NearestFilter so light falls\noff in hard bands, the way hand-shaded sprites look. Values are 0..255 intensity.\n\n### toonGradient()\n\n```ts\nfunction toonGradient(): DataTexture\n```\n\n### toonify()\n\n```ts\nfunction toonify(root: Object3D, options: ToonifyOptions = {}): Object3D\n```\n\nReplace every mesh material under `root` with the shared toon material of the same base\ncolor, keeping its base color texture (`map`, nearest-filtered) and vertex colors. Makes\nany GLB (or hand-built mesh) match the engine's look without per-asset work.\n\n### toonMaterial()\n\n```ts\nfunction toonMaterial(color: ColorRepresentation, options: ToonMaterialOptions = {}): MeshToonNodeMaterial\n```\n\nShared 3-band toon node material for a palette color, optionally textured and/or\nvertex-colored (color × map × vertex color), cached per combination. Untextured ones\n(and ones whose texture is itself shared, e.g. from a cached GLB) are marked\n`userData.shared`, so level unloads keep them; a material with a level's own texture is\ndisposed with the level, and disposing it drops it from the cache.\n\n### interface ToonMaterialOptions\n\n- `map?: Texture | null`: Base color texture. Switched to nearest filtering (crisp texels, no mip blur).\n- `vertexColors?: boolean`: Multiply by the geometry's `color` attribute (vertex colors).\n- `rim?: number`: A hard-banded rim light in this colour (hex) on grazing, upward-facing surfaces: a silhouette that reads against dark floors (monsters in dark levels). Added to the emissive, so `material.emissive` (hit flashes) still works on top. Same shader for every rim c…\n- `dissolve?: boolean`: Pixel dissolve: the material reads its own `dissolve` property (0 = solid, 1 = gone) and discards a per-art-pixel noise pattern below it, with a 1-pixel glowing front in the rim colour (or white). Set it on per-body clones (`material.dissolve = 0.4`), not on…\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='src/art/models.js'\ns=open(p).read().replace('new ModelCatalog([...MODEL_LIBRARY.all(),...ALL_MODELS])','new ModelCatalog([...MODEL_LIBRARY.all().filter(m=>\"'!ALL_MODELS.some(own=>own.id===m.id)),...ALL_MODELS])'\"')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode --input-type=module - <<'JS'\ntry{const {ALL_MODELS,MODELS}=await import('./src/art/models.js');const {checkModel,validateTexture}=await import('./pixel-engine.js');const {flame}=await import('./src/art/textures.js');let n=0;for(const m of ALL_MODELS){try{const r=checkModel(m,{catalog:MODELS});if(r.problems.length){console.log(m.id,r.problems);n++;}}catch(e){console.log(m.id,e.message);n++;}}console.log(ALL_MODELS.length+' models, '+n+' invalid. Texture:',validateTexture(flame).problems);}catch(e){console.log(e.message);}\nJS\ncat >> tests/ISSUES.md <<'EOF'\n1. **Critical, fixed:** Custom cage id collided with a built-in model during module import; the game catalog now replaces same-id library entries explicitly.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='src/art/models.js'\ns=open(p).read().replace('new ModelCatalog([...MODEL_LIBRARY.all(),...ALL_MODELS])','new ModelCatalog([...MODEL_LIBRARY.all().filter(m=>\"'!ALL_MODELS.some(own=>own.id===m.id)),...ALL_MODELS])'\"')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode --input-type=module - <<'JS'\ntry{const {ALL_MODELS,MODELS}=await import('./src/art/models.js');const {checkModel,validateTexture}=await import('./pixel-engine.js');const {flame}=await import('./src/art/textures.js');let n=0;for(const m of ALL_MODELS){try{const r=checkModel(m,{catalog:MODELS});if(r.problems.length){console.log(m.id,r.problems);n++;}}catch(e){console.log(m.id,e.message);n++;}}console.log(ALL_MODELS.length+' models, '+n+' invalid. Texture:',validateTexture(flame).problems);}catch(e){console.log(e.message);}\nJS\ncat >> tests/ISSUES.md <<'EOF'\n1. **Critical, fixed:** Custom cage id collided with a built-in model during module import; the game catalog now replaces same-id library entries explicitly.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"35 models, 0 invalid. Texture: []\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"The basin now has its roads, river, settlements, checkpoints, mine, and vegetation. All 35 original world models pass the engine’s structural checks. Next I’m connecting them to shooting, driving, physical interactions, and the held map."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > src/world/sky.js <<'EOF'\nimport {THREE,applySky,skyAt,groundFog,PALETTE} from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport {clamp,lerp} from '../core/math.js';\nconst HOURS=[[0,'#0b0f20','#141a2e','#1c2238'],[5.5,'#3a4a6b','#d99a6c','#f0b070'],[9,'#6f9fb5','#c9d6c4','#e3cf9e'],[13,'#7fa6b8','#d8dcc0','#ecd9a6'],[16.5,'#7fa6b8','#e9c98f','#d98a4e'],[19,'#2b2f52','#8a4f5c','#c8643c'],[22,'#0b0f20','#141a2e','#1c2238'],[24,'#0b0f20','#141a2e','#1c2238']];\nexport class Sky {\n constructor(g,ctx){this.g=g;this.ctx=ctx;this.clock=1;const geo=new THREE.SphereGeometry(900,24,16);geo.setAttribute('color',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(new Float32Array(geo.getAttribute('position').count*3),3));this.dome=new THREE.Mesh(geo,new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({vertexColors:true,side:THREE.BackSide,fog:false}));this.dome.frustumCulled=false;ctx.scene.add(this.dome);this.fog=groundFog({color:0xd98a4e,top:-60,amount:.55,near:200,far:980});ctx.scene.fogNode=this.fog.node;this.sun=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(10,12,8),new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({color:PALETTE.sand,fog:false}));ctx.scene.add(this.sun);this.starGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry();const pts=[];const r=ctx.random.fork('stars');for(let i=0;i<240;i++){const a=r.range(0,6.283),h=r.range(.1,1);pts.push(Math.cos(a)*750*Math.sqrt(1-h*h),h*750,Math.sin(a)*750*Math.sqrt(1-h*h));}this.starGeo.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(pts,3));this.stars=new THREE.Points(this.starGeo,new THREE.PointsNodeMaterial({color:PALETTE.mist,size:1.3,sizeAttenuation:false,fog:false}));ctx.scene.add(this.stars);this.update(0);}\n update(dt){this.clock+=dt;const g=this.g,cam=this.ctx.camera.camera;this.dome.position.copy(cam.position);this.stars.position.copy(cam.position);this.sun.position.set(cam.position.x-520,cam.position.y+120,cam.position.z-500);if(this.clock<.5)return;this.clock=0;const h=g.hour%24;let i=0;while(i<HOURS.length-2&&h>HOURS[i+1][0])i++;const a=HOURS[i],b=HOURS[i+1],t=(h-a[0])/(b[0]-a[0]);const cols=[1,2,3].map(k=>new THREE.Color(a[k]).lerp(new THREE.Color(b[k]),t));const pos=this.dome.geometry.getAttribute('position'),col=this.dome.geometry.getAttribute('color');for(let v=0;v<pos.count;v++){const y=pos.getY(v)/900;const c=y>.25?cols[1].clone().lerp(cols[0],clamp((y-.25)/.75,0,1)):cols[2].clone().lerp(cols[1],clamp(y/.25,0,1));col.setXYZ(v,c.r,c.g,c.b);}col.needsUpdate=true;applySky(this.ctx.engine,skyAt(h));this.ctx.engine.ambient.intensity=Math.max(this.ctx.engine.ambient.intensity,h<6||h>19?.8:1.25);this.fog.color.value.copy(cols[2]);this.fog.amount.value=g.weather==='storm'?.83:.55;this.sun.visible=h>5.6&&h<19;this.stars.visible=h<6||h>19.5;}\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/audio/sfx.js <<'EOF'\nconst noise=(freq,decay,volume=.3)=>({wave:'noise',freq,freqEnd:Math.max(30,freq*.15),decay,volume});\nconst tone=(freq,decay,volume=.2)=>({wave:'triangle',freq,freqEnd:freq*.5,decay,volume});\nconst gun=(freq,tail)=>({...noise(9000,.11,.55),layers:[{wave:'sine',freq,freqEnd:35,decay:.15,volume:.65},noise(1800,tail,.16)]});\nexport const SFX={\n tractor:gun(125,.3),m38:gun(150,.32),mule:gun(85,.45),empire:gun(105,.6),mg:gun(95,.36),cane:{...noise(350,.12,.25),layers:[tone(140,.09)]},flare:{...noise(1300,.35,.3),layers:[tone(470,.2,.3)]},tube:{...noise(2200,.7,.5),layers:[tone(75,.7,.5)]},weed:noise(1600,.4,.4),\n 'jam':tone(160,.028,.35),'slap':noise(400,.06,.4),'rack':noise(2400,.14,.28),'magazine':{...tone(300,.055,.22),layers:[{...noise(1600,.07,.16),delay:.16}]},'shell':tone(1900,.12,.12),'cylinder':{...tone(750,.08,.15),arp:[0,4,2],arpRate:.04},'flare-hiss':noise(3000,.65,.18),'bottle':{...noise(8600,.22,.4),layers:[tone(1900,.3,.14)]},'explosion':{...noise(2400,1.2,.65),layers:[{wave:'sine',freq:70,freqEnd:20,decay:.8,volume:.8}]},'ricochet':{wave:'sine',freq:2300,freqEnd:300,decay:.18,volume:.18},'whip':noise(8000,.04,.2),'flesh':noise(300,.09,.3),'metal':tone(1100,.28,.26),'break':{...noise(1200,.5,.3),layers:[tone(180,.4,.3)]},\n 'step-dirt':noise(600,.075,.13),'step-grass':noise(1800,.09,.12),'step-road':noise(350,.055,.16),'step-wood':tone(170,.08,.2),'step-water':noise(3200,.18,.17),'breath':noise(450,.6,.09),'heartbeat':{...tone(60,.14,.4),layers:[{...tone(49,.16,.3),delay:.24}]},'syrette':noise(4800,.24,.18),'pliers':{...tone(650,.1,.16),layers:[noise(280,.25,.23)]},'knife':noise(320,.4,.23),'finger':noise(4000,.03,.35),'lighter':{...noise(7000,.045,.25),layers:[{...noise(1000,.3,.15),delay:.08}]},'tablet':{...tone(1300,.07,.2),arp:[0,-2,3,-4],arpRate:.045},'grunt':{wave:'saw',freq:75,freqEnd:48,decay:.33,volume:.2},\n 'fire-loop':noise(1200,2,.2),'wind-loop':noise(350,3,.07),'insects':{wave:'sine',freq:4100,decay:.7,volume:.04,vibrato:{depth:1,rate:30}},'birds':{wave:'sine',freq:1800,freqEnd:3200,decay:.25,volume:.08,arp:[0,4,-2],arpRate:.06},'engine-loop':{wave:'saw',freq:42,decay:1.5,volume:.12,layers:[noise(500,1.5,.06)]},'gravel':noise(1500,.3,.16),'brake':{wave:'sine',freq:800,freqEnd:350,decay:.4,volume:.12},'door':noise(150,.16,.3),'horn':{wave:'square',freq:145,sustain:.4,decay:.15,volume:.15,layers:[{wave:'saw',freq:193,sustain:.4,decay:.15,volume:.1}]},'starter':{wave:'square',freq:45,freqEnd:110,decay:.8,volume:.12},'wrench':{...tone(650,.1,.2),layers:[{...noise(1500,.18,.15),delay:.1}]},'train-clack':{...noise(250,.08,.2),layers:[{...tone(120,.08,.18),delay:.2}]},'whistle':{wave:'triangle',freq:570,sustain:.5,decay:.4,volume:.15,vibrato:{depth:.3,rate:5}},'paper':noise(3700,.27,.18),'tracker':{wave:'sine',freq:1700,decay:.055,volume:.2},'radio':noise(700,.16,.2),'thunder':{...noise(180,.9,.4),layers:[tone(40,1.8,.5)]},'rain-loop':noise(6000,2,.08),'ui-move':tone(500,.035,.1),'ui-confirm':{...tone(700,.1,.12),arp:[0,7],arpRate:.05},'ui-back':tone(300,.08,.12)\n};\nEOF\ncat > src/audio/music.js <<'EOF'\nconst make=(bpm,notes,bass,drums=false)=>({bpm,stepsPerBeat:2,tracks:{lead:{wave:'triangle',attack:.01,decay:.4,volume:.13},bass:{wave:'sine',attack:.1,decay:1,volume:.15},pulse:{wave:'noise',decay:.045,volume:drums?.11:.015}},patterns:{a:{lead:notes,bass,pulse:drums?'C4 . C6 . C4 C6 . C6 C4 . C6 . C4 . C6 .':'C7 . . . . . . . C7 . . . . . . .'}},order:['a']});\nexport const SONGS={\n title:make(74,'D4 . A4 . C5 . A4 . G4 . . . E4 . D4 .','D2 - - - . . . . C2 - - - A1 - - -'),\n day:make(64,'D5 . . . A4 . . . G4 . E4 . D4 . . .','D2 - - - . . . . A1 - - - . . . .'),\n night:make(48,'A4 . . . . . . . D4 . . . . . . .','D2 - - - - - - - . . . . A1 - - -'),\n stalk:make(92,'D3 . D3 . E3 . D3 . A3 . G3 . E3 . . .','D2 . . . D2 . . . C2 . . . C2 . . .',true),\n fight:make(128,'D4 D4 . A4 G4 . D4 . C5 . A4 G4 E4 . D4 .','D2 . D2 . A1 . A1 . C2 . C2 . A1 . A1 .',true),\n fever:make(53,'D4 . Eb4 . A4 . Ab4 . G4 . Eb4 . D4 . . .','D2 - - - Eb2 - - - D2 - - - Ab1 - - -'),\n end:make(58,'D5 . . . C5 . A4 . G4 . . . E4 . D4 .','D2 - - - . . . . . . . . . . . .')\n};\nEOF\ncat > src/audio/director.js <<'EOF'\nimport {SFX} from './sfx.js';\nimport {SONGS} from './music.js';\nimport {hash} from '../core/math.js';\nconst VOICES={odile:[-1,.085,'square'],tibor:[-5,.11,'saw'],vance:[-4,.12,'triangle'],ansa:[4,.095,'square'],bakr:[-7,.09,'saw'],ines:[2,.075,'triangle'],dov:[-8,.13,'saw'],mags:[6,.07,'triangle'],harrow:[-5,.14,'saw'],concord:[-3,.09,'saw'],harvest:[2,.08,'square'],pell:[1,.1,'triangle']};\nexport class Soundscape {\n constructor(g,ctx){this.g=g;this.ctx=ctx;this.queue=[];this.elapsed=0;this.music='';this.musicAge=99;for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(SFX))ctx.audio.register(k,v);ctx.audio.setVolume('music',g.settings.music);ctx.audio.setVolume('sfx',g.settings.effects);this.wind=ctx.audio.loop('wind-loop',{volume:.2});this.rain=ctx.audio.loop('rain-loop',{volume:0});this.engine=ctx.audio.loop('engine-loop',{volume:0});this.ambientClock=0;}\n play(k,volume=1,pitch=0){this.ctx.audio.play(k,{volume,pitch});}\n say(who,text){const [pitch,rate,wave]=VOICES[who]||VOICES.concord;let t=0;for(const word of text.toLowerCase().split(/\\\\s+/)){const n=Math.min(4,Math.max(1,(word.match(/[aeiouy]/g)||[]).length));const h=hash(word);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){const f=150+(h>>(j*4)&31)*5;this.queue.push({at:this.elapsed+t,def:{wave,freq:f,freqEnd:f*.88,attack:.005,decay:.07,volume:.18,layers:[{wave:'sine',freq:640+(h%5)*90,decay:.065,volume:.11},{wave:'sine',freq:1100+(h%7)*115,decay:.06,volume:.06},{wave:'noise',freq:5000,decay:.012,volume:.03}]},pitch:pitch+(word.endsWith('?')?2:word.endsWith('.')?-2:0)});t+=rate;}t+=word.endsWith('.')?.27:word.endsWith(',')?.16:.04;}}\n update(dt){this.elapsed+=dt;this.musicAge+=dt;for(let i=this.queue.length-1;i>=0;i--)if(this.queue[i].at<=this.elapsed){const q=this.queue.splice(i,1)[0];this.ctx.audio.play(q.def,{pitch:q.pitch,volume:this.g.settings.voices});}const g=this.g,wanted=g.mode==='title'||g.screen==='main'?'title':g.screen==='ending'?'end':g.fever?.active?'fever':g.combatAge<8?'fight':g.hour>19||g.hour<6?'night':'day';if(this.music\"'!==wanted&&this.musicAge>12){this.music=wanted;this.musicAge=0;this.ctx.audio.playMusic(SONGS[wanted],wanted);}this.wind.set({volume:.12+g.wind.speed*.025});this.rain.set({volume:g.weather==='\"'storm'?.7:0});this.engine.set({volume:g.vehicle?.6:0,pitch:g.vehicle?Math.abs(g.vehicle.rig.speed)*.3:0});this.ambientClock+=dt;if(this.ambientClock>7){this.ambientClock=0;this.play(g.hour>19||g.hour<6?'insects':'birds',.3);}}\n stop(){this.queue=[];this.ctx.audio.stopMusic();this.ctx.audio.stopLoops();}\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/art/viewmodels.js <<'EOF'\nimport {model} from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nconst box=(s,at,c)=>({box:s,at,c});\nexport const HAND_RIG={joints:['Root','Weapon','Mag','Bolt','ArmR','HandR','ArmL','HandL'],root:'Root',mirror:{},soles:[],trace:[],limits:{},fps:30};\nconst pivot=(name,at,group)=>({name,pivot:true,at,group});\nfunction gunParts(id){const long=['tractor','mule','empire','mg'].includes(id);if(id==='cane')return [box([.045,.07,.6],[0,.02,-.25],'steel'),box([.075,.09,.2],[0,0,.12],'wood')];if(id==='weed'||id==='tube')return [{cyl:[id==='tube'?.17:.1,.8,id==='tube'?.17:.1],at:[0,.06,-.2],rot:[90,0,0],c:'metal'},box([.09,.22,.1],[0,-.08,.05],'wood'),box([.12,.15,.13],[.09,.05,-.15],'steel')];return [box([long?.1:.11,.12,long?.3:.18],[0,.03,-.13],'metal'),box([.085,.2,.1],[0,-.08,.03],'wood'),...(long?[box([.1,.14,.28],[0,-.02,.2],'wood'),box([.1,.1,.24],[0,.035,-.37],'wood')]:[]),{cyl:[.035,long?.39:.19,.035],at:[0,.055,long?-.62:-.31],rot:[90,0,0],c:'steel'},box([.02,.055,.035],[0,.14,long?-.73:-.31],'steel'),...(id==='empire'?[{cyl:[.075,.26,.075],at:[0,.18,-.19],rot:[90,0,0],c:'night'}]:[]),...(id==='m38'?[{cyl:[.12,.1,.12],at:[0,.03,-.12],rot:[90,0,0],c:'steel'}]:[])];}\nexport function viewDef(id){return model({id:'view-'+id,about:'First person '+id+' with articulated hands, magazine and bolt',tags:['viewmodel','weapon'],floats:true,collider:'none',palette:{metal:'night',steel:'slate',wood:'plum',skin:'orange',sleeve:'sand',rust:'red',tape:'mist',night:'ink'},parts:[pivot('Root',[0,0,0],[pivot('Weapon',[0,0,0],[...gunParts(id),pivot('Rust',[0,0,0],[box([.106,.045,.16],[0,.084,-.16],'rust')]),pivot('Tape',[0,0,0],[box([.11,.1,.06],[0,-.015,.22],'tape')])]),pivot('Mag',[0,-.18,-.1],[box([.07,.24,.12],[0,0,0],'metal')]),pivot('Bolt',[.055,.03,-.17],[box([.07,.04,.05],[0,0,0],'steel')]),pivot('ArmR',[.09,-.12,.12],[box([.12,.13,.3],[.015,-.06,.12],'sleeve'),pivot('HandR',[-.015,.005,-.04],[box([.095,.12,.12],[0,0,0],'skin')])]),pivot('ArmL',[-.1,-.11,-.3],[box([.12,.13,.34],[-.025,-.08,.15],'sleeve'),pivot('HandL',[.035,.02,-.03],[box([.095,.085,.15],[0,0,0],'skin')])])])]});}\nexport const VIEW_DEFS=['cane','m38','flare','tractor','mule','empire','weed','tube','mg'].map(viewDef);\nexport const HAND_CLIPS=[\n {name:'Fire',frames:6,fast:true,keys:[[0,{Weapon:{p:[0,0,0]}}],[1,{Weapon:{r:[-5,0,-1],p:[0,.014,.05]}}],[6,{Weapon:{r:[0,0,0],p:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Reload',frames:62,fast:true,keys:[[0,{}],[8,{Root:{r:[0,0,-20],p:[-.035,.025,.08]},ArmL:{p:[.1,-.02,.22]}}],[20,{Mag:{p:[-.1,-.4,.2]},ArmL:{p:[.1,-.34,.26]}}],[38,{Mag:{p:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{p:[.1,0,.2]}}],[48,{Bolt:{p:[0,0,.12]}}],[62,{Root:{r:[0,0,0],p:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{p:[0,0,0]},Bolt:{p:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Unjam',frames:27,fast:true,keys:[[0,{}],[7,{Root:{r:[-10,0,-25]},ArmL:{p:[.14,.08,.17]}}],[12,{Bolt:{p:[0,0,.14]},ArmL:{p:[.14,.08,.3]}}],[17,{Bolt:{p:[0,0,0]}}],[27,{Root:{r:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{p:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Tablet',frames:45,keys:[[0,{}],[8,{Weapon:{p:[0,-.7,0]},Mag:{p:[0,-.7,0]},ArmL:{p:[.04,.1,.13]}}],[22,{ArmL:{p:[.1,.42,.31],r:[-35,0,0]}}],[45,{Weapon:{p:[0,0,0]},Mag:{p:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{p:[0,0,0],r:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Syrette',frames:38,keys:[[0,{}],[10,{Root:{r:[35,0,-18],p:[0,-.16,.05]},ArmL:{p:[.2,-.07,.2]}}],[24,{ArmL:{p:[.2,-.12,.2]}}],[38,{Root:{r:[0,0,0],p:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{p:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n ...['Pliers','Shrapnel','Finger','Cauterise'].map((name,i)=>({name,frames:120,fast:true,keys:[[0,{}],[15,{Weapon:{p:[0,-.8,0]},Mag:{p:[0,-.8,0]},ArmL:{p:[-.03,.06,.28],r:[-10,0,-35]},ArmR:{p:[-.18,.04,-.12]}}],[42,{ArmR:{p:[-.2,.1,-.14],r:[-15,0,i*4-7]}}],[65,{ArmR:{p:[-.13,.12,-.1],r:[-5,0,12]},ArmL:{r:[-20,0,-42]}}],[95,{ArmR:{p:[-.18,.08,-.1]}}],[120,{Weapon:{p:[0,0,0]},Mag:{p:[0,0,0]},ArmR:{p:[0,0,0],r:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{p:[0,0,0],r:[0,0,0]}}]]})),\n {name:'Melee',frames:19,fast:true,keys:[[0,{}],[5,{Root:{r:[0,0,35],p:[.1,.1,.08]}}],[10,{Root:{r:[-25,0,-40],p:[-.14,.02,-.16]}}],[19,{Root:{r:[0,0,0],p:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Throw',frames:28,fast:true,keys:[[0,{}],[8,{Root:{r:[-70,0,-12],p:[.05,.13,.13]}}],[15,{Root:{r:[15,0,0],p:[0,.08,-.13]}}],[28,{Root:{r:[0,0,0],p:[0,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Wrench',frames:24,loop:true,keys:[[0,{Root:{r:[10,0,0]}}],[12,{Root:{r:[10,0,22]}}],[24,{Root:{r:[10,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'Break',frames:35,fast:true,keys:[[0,{}],[12,{Mag:{p:[.05,-.8,.1],r:[45,0,20]},Weapon:{r:[0,0,30]}}],[35,{Root:{p:[0,-1.5,0]}}]]}\n];\nEOF\ncat > src/art/clips.js <<'EOF'\nexport const ACTOR_CLIPS=[\n {name:'AimIdle',frames:30,loop:true,keys:[[0,{ArmR:{r:[-85,0,-15]},ForearmR:{r:[-15,0,0]},ArmL:{r:[-65,0,28]},ForearmL:{r:[-55,0,0]}}],[30,{ArmR:{r:[-85,0,-15]},ForearmR:{r:[-15,0,0]},ArmL:{r:[-65,0,28]},ForearmL:{r:[-55,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'BurnPanic',frames:18,loop:true,fast:true,keys:[[0,{Torso:{r:[15,0,-9]},ArmR:{r:[-110,0,-40]},ArmL:{r:[-95,0,60]},LegR:{r:[45,0,0]},LegL:{r:[-35,0,0]}}],[9,{Torso:{r:[15,0,9]},ArmR:{r:[-80,0,-70]},ArmL:{r:[-130,0,30]},LegR:{r:[-35,0,0]},LegL:{r:[45,0,0]}}],[18,{Torso:{r:[15,0,-9]},ArmR:{r:[-110,0,-40]},ArmL:{r:[-95,0,60]},LegR:{r:[45,0,0]},LegL:{r:[-35,0,0]}}]]},\n {name:'WoundedSit',frames:40,loop:true,keys:[[0,{Pelvis:{p:[0,-.42,0]},Torso:{r:[25,0,10]},LegR:{r:[-65,0,0]},LegL:{r:[-45,0,0]},ArmR:{r:[-30,0,-40]}}],[40,{Pelvis:{p:[0,-.42,0]},Torso:{r:[25,0,10]},LegR:{r:[-65,0,0]},LegL:{r:[-45,0,0]},ArmR:{r:[-30,0,-40]}}]]},\n {name:'DriveSit',frames:30,loop:true,keys:[[0,{Pelvis:{p:[0,-.4,0]},LegR:{r:[-90,0,0]},LegL:{r:[-90,0,0]},ArmR:{r:[-80,0,-10]},ArmL:{r:[-80,0,10]}}],[30,{Pelvis:{p:[0,-.4,0]},LegR:{r:[-90,0,0]},LegL:{r:[-90,0,0]},ArmR:{r:[-80,0,-10]},ArmL:{r:[-80,0,10]}}]]},\n {name:'UnjamSwear',frames:40,keys:[[0,{ArmR:{r:[-80,0,0]}}],[20,{ArmL:{r:[-110,0,20]},Head:{r:[20,0,0]}}],[40,{ArmR:{r:[0,0,0]},ArmL:{r:[0,0,0]},Head:{r:[0,0,0]}}]]}\n];\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > src/world/sky.js <<'EOF'\nimport {THREE,applySky,skyAt,groundFog,PALETTE} from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nimport {clamp,lerp} from '../core/math.js';\nconst HOURS=[[0,'#0b0f20','#141a2e','#1c2238'],[5.5,'#3a4a6b','#d99a6c','#f0b070'],[9,'#6f9fb5','#c9d6c4','#e3cf9e'],[13,'#7fa6b8','#d8dcc0','#ecd9a6'],[16.5,'#7fa6b8','#e9c98f','#d98a4e'],[19,'#2b2f52','#8a4f5c','#c8643c'],[22,'#0b0f20','#141a2e','#1c2238'],[24,'#0b0f20','#141a2e','#1c2238']];\nexport class Sky {\n constructor(g,ctx){this.g=g;this.ctx=ctx;this.clock=1;const geo=new THREE.SphereGeometry(900,24,16);geo.setAttribute('color',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(new Float32Array(geo.getAttribute('position').count*3),3));this.dome=new THREE.Mesh(geo,new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({vertexColors:true,side:THREE.BackSide,fog:false}));this.dome.frustumCulled=false;ctx.scene.add(this.dome);this.fog=groundFog({color:0xd98a4e,top:-60,amount:.55,near:200,far:980});ctx.scene.fogNode=this.fog.node;this.sun=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(10,12,8),new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({color:PALETTE.sand,fog:false}));ctx.scene.add(this.sun);this.starGeo=new THREE.BufferGeometry();const pts=[];const r=ctx.random.fork('stars');for(let i=0;i<240;i++){const a=r.range(0,6.283),h=r.range(.1,1);pts.push(Math.cos(a)*750*Math.sqrt(1-h*h),h*750,Math.sin(a)*750*Math.sqrt(1-h*h));}this.starGeo.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(pts,3));this.stars=new THREE.Points(this.starGeo,new THREE.PointsNodeMaterial({color:PALETTE.mist,size:1.3,sizeAttenuation:false,fog:false}));ctx.scene.add(this.stars);this.update(0);}\n update(dt){this.clock+=dt;const g=this.g,cam=this.ctx.camera.camera;this.dome.position.copy(cam.position);this.stars.position.copy(cam.position);this.sun.position.set(cam.position.x-520,cam.position.y+120,cam.position.z-500);if(this.clock<.5)return;this.clock=0;const h=g.hour%24;let i=0;while(i<HOURS.length-2&&h>HOURS[i+1][0])i++;const a=HOURS[i],b=HOURS[i+1],t=(h-a[0])/(b[0]-a[0]);const cols=[1,2,3].map(k=>new THREE.Color(a[k]).lerp(new THREE.Color(b[k]),t));const pos=this.dome.geometry.getAttribute('position'),col=this.dome.geometry.getAttribute('color');for(let v=0;v<pos.count;v++){const y=pos.getY(v)/900;const c=y>.25?cols[1].clone().lerp(cols[0],clamp((y-.25)/.75,0,1)):cols[2].clone().lerp(cols[1],clamp(y/.25,0,1));col.setXYZ(v,c.r,c.g,c.b);}col.needsUpdate=true;applySky(this.ctx.engine,skyAt(h));this.ctx.engine.ambient.intensity=Math.max(this.ctx.engine.ambient.intensity,h<6||h>19?.8:1.25);this.fog.color.value.copy(cols[2]);this.fog.amount.value=g.weather==='storm'?.83:.55;this.sun.visible=h>5.6&&h<19;this.stars.visible=h<6||h>19.5;}\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/audio/sfx.js <<'EOF'\nconst noise=(freq,decay,volume=.3)=>({wave:'noise',freq,freqEnd:Math.max(30,freq*.15),decay,volume});\nconst tone=(freq,decay,volume=.2)=>({wave:'triangle',freq,freqEnd:freq*.5,decay,volume});\nconst gun=(freq,tail)=>({...noise(9000,.11,.55),layers:[{wave:'sine',freq,freqEnd:35,decay:.15,volume:.65},noise(1800,tail,.16)]});\nexport const SFX={\n tractor:gun(125,.3),m38:gun(150,.32),mule:gun(85,.45),empire:gun(105,.6),mg:gun(95,.36),cane:{...noise(350,.12,.25),layers:[tone(140,.09)]},flare:{...noise(1300,.35,.3),layers:[tone(470,.2,.3)]},tube:{...noise(2200,.7,.5),layers:[tone(75,.7,.5)]},weed:noise(1600,.4,.4),\n 'jam':tone(160,.028,.35),'slap':noise(400,.06,.4),'rack':noise(2400,.14,.28),'magazine':{...tone(300,.055,.22),layers:[{...noise(1600,.07,.16),delay:.16}]},'shell':tone(1900,.12,.12),'cylinder':{...tone(750,.08,.15),arp:[0,4,2],arpRate:.04},'flare-hiss':noise(3000,.65,.18),'bottle':{...noise(8600,.22,.4),layers:[tone(1900,.3,.14)]},'explosion':{...noise(2400,1.2,.65),layers:[{wave:'sine',freq:70,freqEnd:20,decay:.8,volume:.8}]},'ricochet':{wave:'sine',freq:2300,freqEnd:300,decay:.18,volume:.18},'whip':noise(8000,.04,.2),'flesh':noise(300,.09,.3),'metal':tone(1100,.28,.26),'break':{...noise(1200,.5,.3),layers:[tone(180,.4,.3)]},\n 'step-dirt':noise(600,.075,.13),'step-grass':noise(1800,.09,.12),'step-road':noise(350,.055,.16),'step-wood':tone(170,.08,.2),'step-water':noise(3200,.18,.17),'breath':noise(450,.6,.09),'heartbeat':{...tone(60,.14,.4),layers:[{...tone(49,.16,.3),delay:.24}]},'syrette':noise(4800,.24,.18),'pliers':{...tone(650,.1,.16),layers:[noise(280,.25,.23)]},'knife':noise(320,.4,.23),'finger':noise(4000,.03,.35),'lighter':{...noise(7000,.045,.25),layers:[{...noise(1000,.3,.15),delay:.08}]},'tablet':{...tone(1300,.07,.2),arp:[0,-2,3,-4],arpRate:.045},'grunt':{wave:'saw',freq:75,freqEnd:48,decay:.33,volume:.2},\n 'fire-loop':noise(1200,2,.2),'wind-loop':noise(350,3,.07),'insects':{wave:'sine',freq:4100,decay:.7,volume:.04,vibrato:{depth:1,rate:30}},'birds':{wave:'sine',freq:1800,freqEnd:3200,decay:.25,volume:.08,arp:[0,4,-2],arpRate:.06},'engine-loop':{wave:'saw',freq:42,decay:1.5,volume:.12,layers:[noise(500,1.5,.06)]},'gravel':noise(1500,.3,.16),'brake':{wave:'sine',freq:800,freqEnd:350,decay:.4,volume:.12},'door':noise(150,.16,.3),'horn':{wave:'square',freq:145,sustain:.4,decay:.15,volume:.15,layers:[{wave:'saw',freq:193,sustain:.4,decay:.15,volume:.1}]},'starter':{wave:'square',freq:45,freqEnd:110,decay:.8,volume:.12},'wrench':{...tone(650,.1,.2),layers:[{...noise(1500,.18,.15),delay:.1}]},'train-clack':{...noise(250,.08,.2),layers:[{...tone(120,.08,.18),delay:.2}]},'whistle':{wave:'triangle',freq:570,sustain:.5,decay:.4,volume:.15,vibrato:{depth:.3,rate:5}},'paper':noise(3700,.27,.18),'tracker':{wave:'sine',freq:1700,decay:.055,volume:.2},'radio':noise(700,.16,.2),'thunder':{...noise(180,.9,.4),layers:[tone(40,1.8,.5)]},'rain-loop':noise(6000,2,.08),'ui-move':tone(500,.035,.1),'ui-confirm':{...tone(700,.1,.12),arp:[0,7],arpRate:.05},'ui-back':tone(300,.08,.12)\n};\nEOF\ncat > src/audio/music.js <<'EOF'\nconst make=(bpm,notes,bass,drums=false)=>({bpm,stepsPerBeat:2,tracks:{lead:{wave:'triangle',attack:.01,decay:.4,volume:.13},bass:{wave:'sine',attack:.1,decay:1,volume:.15},pulse:{wave:'noise',decay:.045,volume:drums?.11:.015}},patterns:{a:{lead:notes,bass,pulse:drums?'C4 . C6 . C4 C6 . C6 C4 . C6 . C4 . C6 .':'C7 . . . . . . . C7 . . . . . . .'}},order:['a']});\nexport const SONGS={\n title:make(74,'D4 . A4 . C5 . A4 . G4 . . . E4 . D4 .','D2 - - - . . . . C2 - - - A1 - - -'),\n day:make(64,'D5 . . . A4 . . . G4 . E4 . D4 . . .','D2 - - - . . . . A1 - - - . . . .'),\n night:make(48,'A4 . . . . . . . D4 . . . . . . .','D2 - - - - - - - . . . . A1 - - -'),\n stalk:make(92,'D3 . D3 . E3 . D3 . A3 . G3 . E3 . . .','D2 . . . D2 . . . C2 . . . C2 . . .',true),\n fight:make(128,'D4 D4 . A4 G4 . D4 . C5 . A4 G4 E4 . D4 .','D2 . D2 . A1 . A1 . C2 . C2 . A1 . A1 .',true),\n fever:make(53,'D4 . Eb4 . A4 . Ab4 . G4 . Eb4 . D4 . . .','D2 - - - Eb2 - - - D2 - - - Ab1 - - -'),\n end:make(58,'D5 . . . C5 . A4 . G4 . . . E4 . D4 .','D2 - - - . . . . . . . . . . . .')\n};\nEOF\ncat > src/audio/director.js <<'EOF'\nimport {SFX} from './sfx.js';\nimport {SONGS} from './music.js';\nimport {hash} from '../core/math.js';\nconst VOICES={odile:[-1,.085,'square'],tibor:[-5,.11,'saw'],vance:[-4,.12,'triangle'],ansa:[4,.095,'square'],bakr:[-7,.09,'saw'],ines:[2,.075,'triangle'],dov:[-8,.13,'saw'],mags:[6,.07,'triangle'],harrow:[-5,.14,'saw'],concord:[-3,.09,'saw'],harvest:[2,.08,'square'],pell:[1,.1,'triangle']};\nexport class Soundscape {\n constructor(g,ctx){this.g=g;this.ctx=ctx;this.queue=[];this.elapsed=0;this.music='';this.musicAge=99;for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(SFX))ctx.audio.register(k,v);ctx.audio.setVolume('music',g.settings.music);ctx.audio.setVolume('sfx',g.settings.effects);this.wind=ctx.audio.loop('wind-loop',{volume:.2});this.rain=ctx.audio.loop('rain-loop',{volume:0});this.engine=ctx.audio.loop('engine-loop',{volume:0});this.ambientClock=0;}\n play(k,volume=1,pitch=0){this.ctx.audio.play(k,{volume,pitch});}\n say(who,text){const [pitch,rate,wave]=VOICES[who]||VOICES.concord;let t=0;for(const word of text.toLowerCase().split(/\\\\s+/)){const n=Math.min(4,Math.max(1,(word.match(/[aeiouy]/g)||[]).length));const h=hash(word);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){const f=150+(h>>(j*4)&31)*5;this.queue.push({at:this.elapsed+t,def:{wave,freq:f,freqEnd:f*.88,attack:.005,decay:.07,volume:.18,layers:[{wave:'sine',freq:640+(h%5)*90,decay:.065,volume:.11},{wave:'sine',freq:1100+(h%7)*115,decay:.06,volume:.06},{wave:'noise',freq:5000,decay:.012,volume:.03}]},pitch:pitch+(word.endsWith('?')?2:word.endsWith('.')?-2:0)});t+=rate;}t+=word.endsWith('.')?.27:word.endsWith(',')?.16:.04;}}\n update(dt){this.elapsed+=dt;this.musicAge+=dt;for(let i=this.queue.length-1;i>=0;i--)if(this.queue[i].at<=this.elapsed){const q=this.queue.splice(i,1)[0];this.ctx.audio.play(q.def,{pitch:q.pitch,volume:this.g.settings.voices});}const g=this.g,wanted=g.mode==='title'||g.screen==='main'?'title':g.screen==='ending'?'end':g.fever?.active?'fever':g.combatAge<8?'fight':g.hour>19||g.hour<6?'night':'day';if(this.music\"'!==wanted&&this.musicAge>12){this.music=wanted;this.musicAge=0;this.ctx.audio.playMusic(SONGS[wanted],wanted);}this.wind.set({volume:.12+g.wind.speed*.025});this.rain.set({volume:g.weather==='\"'storm'?.7:0});this.engine.set({volume:g.vehicle?.6:0,pitch:g.vehicle?Math.abs(g.vehicle.rig.speed)*.3:0});this.ambientClock+=dt;if(this.ambientClock>7){this.ambientClock=0;this.play(g.hour>19||g.hour<6?'insects':'birds',.3);}}\n stop(){this.queue=[];this.ctx.audio.stopMusic();this.ctx.audio.stopLoops();}\n}\nEOF\ncat > src/art/viewmodels.js <<'EOF'\nimport {model} from '../../pixel-engine.js';\nconst box=(s,at,c)=>({box:s,at,c});\nexport const HAND_RIG={joints:['Root','Weapon','Mag','Bolt','ArmR','HandR','ArmL','HandL'],root:'Root',mirror:{},soles:[],trace:[],limits:{},fps:30};\nconst pivot=(name,at,group)=>({name,pivot:true,at,group});\nfunction gunParts(id){const long=['tractor','mule','empire','mg'].includes(id);if(id==='cane')return [box([.045,.07,.6],[0,.02,-.25],'steel'),box([.075,.09,.2],[0