{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"The first campaign run caught two integration problems: rifle shots can hit the player’s own capsule after physics steps, and the full scene sometimes misses the hub’s loading deadline. I’m fixing self-filtering for shots and reducing what the Cash Run loads at startup."}}
